  Description: 'Modifies the spell so that its Impact is applied within an area,
    affecting multiple enemies simultaneously.


    Each enemy within the area receives
    the Impact effect individually. Stacking this rune increases the size of the
    area of effect.


    Area based Impacts cannot trigger additional Area of Effect
    events.

'
